{#
  STT name hints: the names the player is likely to say, sent to speech-to-text with each
  push-to-talk and open-mic utterance (STT.yaml name_hints, on by default) so they come back
  spelled right. Local Whisper reads this as text heard just before the speech; hosted services
  take it as their prompt.

  Rendered like any prompt, with the standard variables and decorators, in the background (on a
  cell change, else every 30 s) and at each push-to-talk press. Keep it short and plain:
  - The text is held to 500 characters, cut at the last comma, period or semicolon that fits, so
    list the most likely names first.
  - Line breaks become spaces, and Whisper copies the style of what it reads.
  - Fateless also gets each piece between commas, periods, colons and line breaks of up to five
    words as a keyword, so a list of names gives it exactly the names.
  Render nothing to send no hints.
#}
{%- for npc in get_nearby_npc_list(player.UUID) %}{{ npc.name }}, {% endfor -%}
{%- for place in get_place_names("current") %}{{ place }}, {% endfor -%}
{{ player.name }}
{%- for name in get_npc_group_members("Pinned") %}, {{ name }}{% endfor -%}
{%- for place in get_place_names("nearby") %}, {{ place }}{% endfor %}.
